ubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 28 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%9411-%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%9D%A1%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%BF/</guid><description>杨医生温馨小贴士 脊柱是人体的第二条生命线，是非常重要的，在人体当中占据着非常重要的地位。如果脊柱遇到问题了，会对人体的健康造成很大的影响。 大</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>脊椎</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔10 | 孝</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%9410-%E5%AD%9D/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 18 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%9410-%E5%AD%9D/</guid><description>小医生随笔 今天是二阳、后遗症的讲解，还是不少人来，虽然很多都讲了足足四年，仍有那么多后遗症患者。 除了讲到公众号有的那些专业信息，这次提到了I</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>孝</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔9 | 智慧</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%949-%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 24 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%949-%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</guid><description>小医生随笔 今年去寺庙的人多了很多很多，其中不少年轻人。大家觉得是选择上班还是上进更重要？结果选择了上香。其实学佛的本意并非是为了日子过的好些</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>智慧</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔8 三伏天养生</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%948-%E4%B8%89%E4%BC%8F%E5%A4%A9%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 12 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%948-%E4%B8%89%E4%BC%8F%E5%A4%A9%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F/</guid><description>小医生随笔 大家好，今年不同往年，也是近几十年来可以说是最为反常的一年。7月11日开始了三伏天的第一天，整个三伏天这次会持续40天，是对人体巨</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>三伏天</category><category>艾灸</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔（7）| 夏季养生</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%947-%E5%A4%8F%E5%AD%A3%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F/</link><pubDate>Thu, 06 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 06 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%947-%E5%A4%8F%E5%AD%A3%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F/</guid><description>小医生随笔 脾胃乃后天之本。夏季阳浮于外，身体本身的阳不够，加上暑湿，人极易反胃、湿重。阳明胃经上有一重要穴位，足三里。 艾灸时先左后右，可以帮</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>足三里</category><category>艾灸</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔（6）| 你真的会艾灸吗？</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94-6-%E4%BD%A0%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%9A%E8%89%BE%E7%81%B8%E5%90%97/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 29 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94-6-%E4%BD%A0%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%9A%E8%89%BE%E7%81%B8%E5%90%97/</guid><description>小医生随笔 艾灸使用方便、效果卓然，已经得到了非常广的普及，但面临两个问题：第一是材料；第二是如何艾灸。 我经常发现很多人身上绑着一大串艾灸盒，</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>能量</category><category>艾草</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔（5）| 能量</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%945-%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sat, 03 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 03 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%945-%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>小医生随笔 天地间的阳气升发需要足够的力量，而这股力量来自本身孕育的能量。古时人们发现、学习并利用这一规律，采摘端午前后自然生长的野生艾草。因</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>能量</category><category>艾草</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔（4）| 奇方之首</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%944-%E5%A5%87%E6%96%B9%E4%B9%8B%E9%A6%96/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 28 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%944-%E5%A5%87%E6%96%B9%E4%B9%8B%E9%A6%96/</guid><description>小医生随笔 中药有七方之说，分别为大方、小方、缓方、急方、奇方、偶方、复方。作为奇方之首的，就是独参汤，一些疑难杂症、甚至快不行的人都可以用这</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>养生</category><category>人参</category><category>红糖</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔（3）| 春夏养阳</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%943%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F%E5%85%BB%E9%98%B3/</link><pubDate>Wed, 10 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 10 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%943%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F%E5%85%BB%E9%98%B3/</guid><description>小医生随笔 古语说的好，“秋冬养阴，春夏养阳，春夏不养阳，一年都白忙”。养阳有很多种方法，运动、早睡早起、清淡饮食、中药调理、艾灸等，看你选择</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>养生</category><category>过敏</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小医生随笔（2） | 防过敏</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%942-%E9%98%B2%E8%BF%87%E6%95%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 19 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%942-%E9%98%B2%E8%BF%87%E6%95%8F/</guid><description>杨医生温馨小贴士 又到了一个过敏的季节，这次推荐大家的防治过敏穴位分别是先命门后大椎，再左肾腧、右肾腧，最后神阙、关元、足三里。 如果大家时间不</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>养生</category><category>过敏</category><category>小医生随笔</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item></channel></rss>